(173200, 9595, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  The black and white is perfect.  The light coming through the window illuminating your face is beautiful. A definite 10.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  The black and white is perfect.  The light coming through the window illuminating your face is beautiful. A definite 10.', '2002-12-16 08:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
