(173202, 9695, 3859, '<td valign="top">The dark corners on the left are a bit distracting.  But you''ve done a great job, better than many here, of actually showing an occupation.  I like the movement in her left hand.</td>', 'The dark corners on the left are a bit distracting.  But you''ve done a great job, better than many here, of actually showing an occupation.  I like the movement in her left hand.', '2002-12-16 08:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
