(173655, 9620, 543, '<td valign="top">All it needs is a grandchild tugging at your sleeve.  The manic look works well with your props.</td>', 'All it needs is a grandchild tugging at your sleeve.  The manic look works well with your props.', '2002-12-16 16:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(173658, 9594, 327, '<td valign="top">"What''s ya gonna do when they come for you?" Very good shot, but the front of your bike is cut off? I do love the focus and the light. Very nice. Cool shorts too. ;O)</td>', '"What''s ya gonna do when they come for you?" Very good shot, but the front of your bike is cut off? I do love the focus and the light. Very nice. Cool shorts too. ;O)', '2002-12-16 16:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(173660, 9604, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  THe Disney call center is as frenetic and colorful as I ever imagined it would be!  I hope it''s a fun place to work!</td>', 'Wow!  THe Disney call center is as frenetic and colorful as I ever imagined it would be!  I hope it''s a fun place to work!', '2002-12-16 16:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(173662, 9622, 1379, '<td valign="top">But at least you get to attend school, right?  It could be worse!</td>', 'But at least you get to attend school, right?  It could be worse!', '2002-12-16 16:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(173663, 9804, 4275, '<td valign="top">MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM. Not bad but I think its a little dark up the top and a little light down the bottom maybe some artificial lighting up the top wouldent have gone a miss but good crisp photo 7. From the Slimharpo</td>', 'MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM. Not bad but I think its a little dark up the top and a little light down the bottom maybe some artificial lighting up the top wouldent have gone a miss but good crisp photo 7. From the Slimharpo', '2002-12-16 16:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(173664, 9600, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL...............very cute. This is a fun shot. Good focus, color, creative idea. Nice job!!!</td>', 'LOL...............very cute. This is a fun shot. Good focus, color, creative idea. Nice job!!!', '2002-12-16 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(173665, 9690, 543, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  My only critique is that I''d like to see more of that light on the book instead of just having one corner brightly lit.  It would make a nicer gradient on the wall, too.  Small potatoes.  Well done!</td>', 'Nicely done.  My only critique is that I''d like to see more of that light on the book instead of just having one corner brightly lit.  It would make a nicer gradient on the wall, too.  Small potatoes.  Well done!', '2002-12-16 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173667, 9652, 1379, '<td valign="top">The one that got away!  What beautiful wings it has!</td>', 'The one that got away!  What beautiful wings it has!', '2002-12-16 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(173668, 9734, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL fantastic. Love your creative mind.......LOLROFLOL Fun shot. Good light, color, composition.</td>', 'LOL fantastic. Love your creative mind.......LOLROFLOL Fun shot. Good light, color, composition.', '2002-12-16 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(173670, 9658, 543, '<td valign="top">Here''s a composition that would benefit from a little more symmetry.  Shave just a fraction off the R side and shift the glass left.  That nit aside, I''m impressed with your control of light and reflection.  Glass is a tough subject.</td>', 'Here''s a composition that would benefit from a little more symmetry.  Shave just a fraction off the R side and shift the glass left.  That nit aside, I''m impressed with your control of light and reflection.  Glass is a tough subject.', '2002-12-16 16:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173671, 9806, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The little child totally makes this kind of ordinary shot really exciting!  I wonder what made her/him so animated!</td>', 'Wow!  The little child totally makes this kind of ordinary shot really exciting!  I wonder what made her/him so animated!', '2002-12-16 17:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(173673, 9778, 543, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting elements, but rather spoiled by the soft focus (especially in the foreground).</td>', 'Lots of interesting elements, but rather spoiled by the soft focus (especially in the foreground).', '2002-12-16 17:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(173674, 9797, 327, '<td valign="top">Super shot.......I love this. Very industral, good color, good light, good focus.....NICE shot. I like it.</td>', 'Super shot.......I love this. Very industral, good color, good light, good focus.....NICE shot. I like it.', '2002-12-16 17:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(173675, 9675, 1379, '<td valign="top">Dang, you could be right.... This just MIGHT be the coolest job in the world!</td>', 'Dang, you could be right.... This just MIGHT be the coolest job in the world!', '2002-12-16 17:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(173676, 9593, 543, '<td valign="top">With a little reflection control, this would be excellent.  Love the tight composition and sharpness, but the flourescents &amp;c. detract.</td>', 'With a little reflection control, this would be excellent.  Love the tight composition and sharpness, but the flourescents &c. detract.', '2002-12-16 17:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(173678, 9646, 1379, '<td valign="top">Achingly cute, but.... homeless cats, starving children, etc........................</td>', 'Achingly cute, but.... homeless cats, starving children, etc........................', '2002-12-16 17:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(173679, 9750, 543, '<td valign="top">A very interesting effect here.  Very painterly.  The overexposure at the window behind you makes me cringe, though, and steals useful tonal range from the rest of the image.</td>', 'A very interesting effect here.  Very painterly.  The overexposure at the window behind you makes me cringe, though, and steals useful tonal range from the rest of the image.', '2002-12-16 17:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(173680, 9817, 1379, '<td valign="top">At least you have daylight!</td>', 'At least you have daylight!', '2002-12-16 17:04:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(173681, 9787, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Even better w/o the bit of tree and tower at R.</td>', 'Nice.  Even better w/o the bit of tree and tower at R.', '2002-12-16 17:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(173688, 9798, 543, '<td valign="top">I like this as a vertical composition, cropped to a 4:3 ratio from the left side.  Includes all the relevant bits and avoids some of the less helpful stuff on the L side.  Nice this way, too - just a suggestion.</td>', 'I like this as a vertical composition, cropped to a 4:3 ratio from the left side.  Includes all the relevant bits and avoids some of the less helpful stuff on the L side.  Nice this way, too - just a suggestion.', '2002-12-16 17:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(173689, 9799, 543, '<td valign="top">Trippy.  Got you on the hamster wheel, have they?</td>', 'Trippy.  Got you on the hamster wheel, have they?', '2002-12-16 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(173692, 9706, 543, '<td valign="top">That''s what I want for my combined birthday/X-mas present.  Can you get my wife a deal?  It''s a nice catch.  Might be more interesting with a slower shutter so the props were frozen.</td>', 'That''s what I want for my combined birthday/X-mas present.  Can you get my wife a deal?  It''s a nice catch.  Might be more interesting with a slower shutter so the props were frozen.', '2002-12-16 17:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(173694, 9629, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2002-12-16 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(173695, 9668, 543, '<td valign="top">Better with the light source moved behind your right shoulder, perhaps.  Great sharpness and a nice, tight comp.</td>', 'Better with the light source moved behind your right shoulder, perhaps.  Great sharpness and a nice, tight comp.', '2002-12-16 17:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(173696, 9773, 543, '<td valign="top">Sorry... the dog ate my comment.  &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Sorry... the dog ate my comment.  <g>', '2002-12-16 17:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(173699, 9785, 543, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Better, IMO, from a lower angle to give the glasses more stature.  More even light on the bg would help, too.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Better, IMO, from a lower angle to give the glasses more stature.  More even light on the bg would help, too.', '2002-12-16 17:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(173701, 9686, 4793, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you could have lightened this shot up a bit,</td>', 'Perhaps you could have lightened this shot up a bit,', '2002-12-16 17:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(173702, 9751, 543, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... overexposure, posterization, soft focus, and needs a flip to make the lettering on the shirt read right.  Almost so bad it''s good, but not quite.</td>', 'Hmmm... overexposure, posterization, soft focus, and needs a flip to make the lettering on the shirt read right.  Almost so bad it''s good, but not quite.', '2002-12-16 17:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(173705, 9596, 543, '<td valign="top">For starters (and, I''m sure, for the tenth time), you''re allowed to make your image 640 pixels on the long dimension.  It''s really hard to see at the posted size.  From what I can see, the flash shadows aren''t objectionable, and you''ve excluded distracting elements from the composition.  The flash eyes on the dog are a little creepy.</td>', 'For starters (and, I''m sure, for the tenth time), you''re allowed to make your image 640 pixels on the long dimension.  It''s really hard to see at the posted size.  From what I can see, the flash shadows aren''t objectionable, and you''ve excluded distracting elements from the composition.  The flash eyes on the dog are a little creepy.', '2002-12-16 17:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(173710, 9797, 3032, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is my winner for this week!<br/>Great subject, very good composition, excellent exposure and depth. The reflection on the railway and the way they bend lead you into the picture.<br/>Very good detail love the color, good choice of time for exposure, I think it doesn''t look so nice in daylight. :-)</td>', 'WOW! This is my winner for this week!Great subject, very good composition, excellent exposure and depth. The reflection on the railway and the way they bend lead you into the picture.Very good detail love the color, good choice of time for exposure, I think it doesn''t look so nice in daylight. :-)', '2002-12-16 17:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(173718, 9754, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great how the underexposure of the photographers details focus all attention on the legs at the right. Nice choice of color, good and interesting composition,.<br/>Shame that there seems to be a wedding ring on that finger. :-)</td>', 'Great how the underexposure of the photographers details focus all attention on the legs at the right. Nice choice of color, good and interesting composition,.Shame that there seems to be a wedding ring on that finger. :-)', '2002-12-16 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173721, 9743, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great depth, mouthwatering colors. I don''t know if I want a cup of coffee or chocolate......... I think I''ll have both. :-)<br/>Good composition, nice lighting. It is also a good thing that the cup is not totally white, the texture adds flavor to the picture. :-)</td>', 'Great depth, mouthwatering colors. I don''t know if I want a cup of coffee or chocolate......... I think I''ll have both. :-)Good composition, nice lighting. It is also a good thing that the cup is not totally white, the texture adds flavor to the picture. :-)', '2002-12-16 17:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(173723, 9690, 3032, '<td valign="top">The best student shot in this challenge. The lighting  and composition is just excellent. Nice colors, like time has stood still since the monks studying their bibles in their dark brown cells.</td>', 'The best student shot in this challenge. The lighting  and composition is just excellent. Nice colors, like time has stood still since the monks studying their bibles in their dark brown cells.', '2002-12-16 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(173726, 9594, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great motion picture also. Nice use of slow shutter, a bit of camera shake an the freezing effect of the flash. I also like the tight crop.</td>', 'Great motion picture also. Nice use of slow shutter, a bit of camera shake an the freezing effect of the flash. I also like the tight crop.', '2002-12-16 17:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(173729, 9816, 3032, '<td valign="top">Found some gold yet?</td>', 'Found some gold yet?', '2002-12-16 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(173730, 9689, 5149, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Tricky time of the day to shoot, but you got a beautiful exposure. Besides all the technical stuff, it''s just a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Great photo. Tricky time of the day to shoot, but you got a beautiful exposure. Besides all the technical stuff, it''s just a beautiful shot.', '2002-12-16 17:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(173731, 9690, 5149, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo. The lighting matches the mood and sets the tone perfectly. Great job.</td>', 'Really nice photo. The lighting matches the mood and sets the tone perfectly. Great job.', '2002-12-16 18:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(173736, 9658, 5677, '<td valign="top">Cool colors</td>', 'Cool colors', '2002-12-16 18:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(173737, 9686, 3936, '<td valign="top">I like the pcture, but it seems dark.  Perhaps my monitor, but the other pictures seem ok.  6</td>', 'I like the pcture, but it seems dark.  Perhaps my monitor, but the other pictures seem ok.  6', '2002-12-16 18:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(173739, 9666, 3936, '<td valign="top">Yumm, but looking for a smoke ring on them ribs.  (Not so much of a barbecue snob that I''d pass up good ribs no matter how they was fixed.)  Oh yeah, the picture...  I like it too.  The condiments of the upper left corner are a tiny bit distracting.  But good job getting the detail in the ribs and beans without washing out the salad.  8</td>', 'Yumm, but looking for a smoke ring on them ribs.  (Not so much of a barbecue snob that I''d pass up good ribs no matter how they was fixed.)  Oh yeah, the picture...  I like it too.  The condiments of the upper left corner are a tiny bit distracting.  But good job getting the detail in the ribs and beans without washing out the salad.  8', '2002-12-16 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(173741, 9668, 3936, '<td valign="top">Great shot the best pictures tell the story.  I love this one.  There is so much here to see.  10!</td>', 'Great shot the best pictures tell the story.  I love this one.  There is so much here to see.  10!', '2002-12-16 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(173742, 9642, 3936, '<td valign="top">Ahhh playing the cute kid card....  Ok, you win.  Nice shot 9.</td>', 'Ahhh playing the cute kid card....  Ok, you win.  Nice shot 9.', '2002-12-16 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(173744, 9597, 5023, '<td valign="top">now this is cool...Ilike this very much.  great job +8</td>', 'now this is cool...Ilike this very much.  great job +8', '2002-12-16 18:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(173747, 9805, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very sharp well focused photo, Well cropped, good subject.  Maybe a little dark, could use a little less contrast.  Roses seem a little blown out.  Just a little busy for me.  Not zooming so closely might help that.  Probably came in tight so could read the pring, and you can, but this made it appear cramped.  Otherwise a real good photo.  Nice 7 PTL</td>', 'Very sharp well focused photo, Well cropped, good subject.  Maybe a little dark, could use a little less contrast.  Roses seem a little blown out.  Just a little busy for me.  Not zooming so closely might help that.  Probably came in tight so could read the pring, and you can, but this made it appear cramped.  Otherwise a real good photo.  Nice 7 PTL', '2002-12-16 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(173748, 9615, 4648, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W good choice for this one.  Love how the texture of the camera, as well as what it is sitting on comes through.  Good job there.  But the background should have covered all of the background.  Black spot in upper right corner is distracting.  Overall shows the features of the camera, right down to the name on the front, very well..  The back of it is out of focus but not enough to hurt that much.  In my opinion this is a nice 8.  PTL</td>', 'B&W good choice for this one.  Love how the texture of the camera, as well as what it is sitting on comes through.  Good job there.  But the background should have covered all of the background.  Black spot in upper right corner is distracting.  Overall shows the features of the camera, right down to the name on the front, very well..  The back of it is out of focus but not enough to hurt that much.  In my opinion this is a nice 8.  PTL', '2002-12-16 18:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(173749, 9716, 4648, '<td valign="top">Unique way to represent a computer.  Biggest problem is the white background.  It blows out the photo, with the white cord and what appears to be a translucent mouse.  Well focused, good composition, well cropped, just needs better execution.  Still a 6.  PTL</td>', 'Unique way to represent a computer.  Biggest problem is the white background.  It blows out the photo, with the white cord and what appears to be a translucent mouse.  Well focused, good composition, well cropped, just needs better execution.  Still a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-16 18:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(173751, 9813, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m taking it the spot on the forehead is where the shot is lined up to hit.  Just toooooo dark.  Can''t see enough of the face.  Good idea, just poor execution - oops that was a poor choice of words, too.  Sorry can''t give but a 2, and that''s mainly for the idea. PTL</td>', 'I''m taking it the spot on the forehead is where the shot is lined up to hit.  Just toooooo dark.  Can''t see enough of the face.  Good idea, just poor execution - oops that was a poor choice of words, too.  Sorry can''t give but a 2, and that''s mainly for the idea. PTL', '2002-12-16 18:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(173753, 9672, 4648, '<td valign="top">What a unique way to advertise.  Good photo, well focused.  Like the cropping and the black background.  Only problem I have is it is just a little dark at the tops of the finger puppets.  You almost lost the top of the elephant and lion.  I say this realizing if you lightened much more you would blow out your sign, so it came down to choice.  You chose the better of the two, in my opinion.  Main thing it lacks for me is "wow" and personal interest.  But it is a good solid 8.  PTL</td>', 'What a unique way to advertise.  Good photo, well focused.  Like the cropping and the black background.  Only problem I have is it is just a little dark at the tops of the finger puppets.  You almost lost the top of the elephant and lion.  I say this realizing if you lightened much more you would blow out your sign, so it came down to choice.  You chose the better of the two, in my opinion.  Main thing it lacks for me is "wow" and personal interest.  But it is a good solid 8.  PTL', '2002-12-16 19:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(173754, 9749, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is so cute.  Hope you don''t use it building or repairing computers.  Get a screwdriver, please.  Good idea, good composition, like the cropping, nice execution.  Only complaint is a little dark.  The apple could stand out better if there were a little more lite on it or whole photo lightened a little.  Other wise good shot, worth a 7 for sure.  PTL</td>', 'This is so cute.  Hope you don''t use it building or repairing computers.  Get a screwdriver, please.  Good idea, good composition, like the cropping, nice execution.  Only complaint is a little dark.  The apple could stand out better if there were a little more lite on it or whole photo lightened a little.  Other wise good shot, worth a 7 for sure.  PTL', '2002-12-16 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(173757, 9811, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute all time favorite photo!!!  It is awesome.  Some of my likes are,  starting at the top:  The beautiful blue sky with the green lights in the top section; dropping to the red glow of the lights on the next 2 sections, with a slight red glow of the sky next to them; coming on down to all the office lights on in the next section bringing us in the the sunset; which is a beautiful soft red mixing into a beautiful yellow; bringing us down to the dark bottom, which is a fitting ending place.  My dislikes:  that this is not mine and hanging on my wall right n ow, or better yet a mural .  This is awesome and the epitomy of great photography.  Congratulations on a job well done.  You deserve a score of 20 in my opinion, but since I can''t I''ll give you 2  tens.  PTL</td>', 'This is my absolute all time favorite photo!!!  It is awesome.  Some of my likes are,  starting at the top:  The beautiful blue sky with the green lights in the top section; dropping to the red glow of the lights on the next 2 sections, with a slight red glow of the sky next to them; coming on down to all the office lights on in the next section bringing us in the the sunset; which is a beautiful soft red mixing into a beautiful yellow; bringing us down to the dark bottom, which is a fitting ending place.  My dislikes:  that this is not mine and hanging on my wall right n ow, or better yet a mural .  This is awesome and the epitomy of great photography.  Congratulations on a job well done.  You deserve a score of 20 in my opinion, but since I can''t I''ll give you 2  tens.  PTL', '2002-12-16 19:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(173758, 9679, 2223, '<td valign="top">Hahahaaha!!!</td>', 'Hahahaaha!!!', '2002-12-16 19:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(173759, 9785, 2223, '<td valign="top">You make beer???</td>', 'You make beer???', '2002-12-16 19:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(173762, 9747, 2866, '<td valign="top">Do you have any openings? -8-<br/></td>', 'Do you have any openings? -8-', '2002-12-16 19:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(173763, 9760, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the way you did this shot.  B&amp;W works well for you in this shot.  Needs to be a little lighter and your surrounding area is cluttered, which I realize is at work, so won''t take off much for that.  Easy to tell what your job is so met the challenge well.  Overall score is a respectable 7.  PTL</td>', 'I like the way you did this shot.  B&W works well for you in this shot.  Needs to be a little lighter and your surrounding area is cluttered, which I realize is at work, so won''t take off much for that.  Easy to tell what your job is so met the challenge well.  Overall score is a respectable 7.  PTL', '2002-12-16 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(173766, 9592, 4648, '<td valign="top">Sell, taste, or manufacture?  Love the texture and color of your background, and the table they are sitting one.  Don''t understand why you have them offset on the table, and the brown button(?) on the table on the right is distracting.  Also the white streaks going down the bottle and the can are very distracting.  Soft focus is ok with me on this, rather like it in fact.  Clear up the small shadows of the table, the light streaks, and the brown button and it''s a great picture.  Still worth a 7, as it it.   PTL</td>', 'Sell, taste, or manufacture?  Love the texture and color of your background, and the table they are sitting one.  Don''t understand why you have them offset on the table, and the brown button(?) on the table on the right is distracting.  Also the white streaks going down the bottle and the can are very distracting.  Soft focus is ok with me on this, rather like it in fact.  Clear up the small shadows of the table, the light streaks, and the brown button and it''s a great picture.  Still worth a 7, as it it.   PTL', '2002-12-16 19:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173778, 9622, 4648, '<td valign="top">Your biggest problem with this whole photo is ---- it is a lie!!!  No student ever studied at this neat of a desk.  I love the color of the desk, and feel you should have used the desk as the entire background without any of the wall.  I personally think you cropped it a little too tight on the left side.  Should have let the edges of the books be in, even if you had to slide them closer to the paper, like the text book is.  That would have made it more uniform, also.  Otherwise, good shot worthy of a 7.  PTL</td>', 'Your biggest problem with this whole photo is ---- it is a lie!!!  No student ever studied at this neat of a desk.  I love the color of the desk, and feel you should have used the desk as the entire background without any of the wall.  I personally think you cropped it a little too tight on the left side.  Should have let the edges of the books be in, even if you had to slide them closer to the paper, like the text book is.  That would have made it more uniform, also.  Otherwise, good shot worthy of a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-16 19:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(173788, 9797, 326, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2002-12-16 19:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(173793, 9660, 326, '<td valign="top">and I won''t pass.....lol Good job.</td>', 'and I won''t pass.....lol Good job.', '2002-12-16 20:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(173804, 9690, 5120, '<td valign="top">I think this one deserves to win this week</td>', 'I think this one deserves to win this week', '2002-12-16 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(173805, 9658, 326, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors! Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful colors! Great job.', '2002-12-16 20:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(173811, 9739, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice job!</td>', 'Nice job!', '2002-12-16 20:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
