(173862, 9795, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is being at the right place at the right time.  A once in a lifetime shot.  Good photo.  I would have cropped a good bit of the black sky off and "tried" to focus it on the level of the street.  Hope this was a long zoom lens you used or you got mighty hot taking it.  If long zoom, just not zoomed so closely.  Even gotten more to each side, especially to the right.  .  Congratulations of being there at that time.  Hope this does well for you.  I''ll give it a 7, especially for the event.  PTL</td>', 'This is being at the right place at the right time.  A once in a lifetime shot.  Good photo.  I would have cropped a good bit of the black sky off and "tried" to focus it on the level of the street.  Hope this was a long zoom lens you used or you got mighty hot taking it.  If long zoom, just not zoomed so closely.  Even gotten more to each side, especially to the right.  .  Congratulations of being there at that time.  Hope this does well for you.  I''ll give it a 7, especially for the event.  PTL', '2002-12-16 21:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(173865, 9653, 4585, '<td valign="top">Love the subject and the BW format....was there anyway to kill that background?  a different POV?.....7</td>', 'Love the subject and the BW format....was there anyway to kill that background?  a different POV?.....7', '2002-12-16 21:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
