(173870, 9618, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this is a computer - I know very little about the use of them, much less the inners and workings of.  You could  tell me anything was a computer and I would believe you.  The picture is clear, but soft in focus, which I like.  Too sharp with those colors could hurt the eyes.  You must know what you are doing with computers and appear to know with cameras.  Good job.  A solid 7.  PTL</td>', 'I''m assuming this is a computer - I know very little about the use of them, much less the inners and workings of.  You could  tell me anything was a computer and I would believe you.  The picture is clear, but soft in focus, which I like.  Too sharp with those colors could hurt the eyes.  You must know what you are doing with computers and appear to know with cameras.  Good job.  A solid 7.  PTL', '2002-12-16 21:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(173874, 9646, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful kitten, but I had no idea they were THAT expensive.  I have a Maine Coon.  He doesn''t look happy to have had a bath.  Wish his wrap had covered the top corners also.  The top right hand corner is beginning to be blown out.  Love how white your whites turned out.  Good job.  Where''s his eyes?  Solid 8.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful kitten, but I had no idea they were THAT expensive.  I have a Maine Coon.  He doesn''t look happy to have had a bath.  Wish his wrap had covered the top corners also.  The top right hand corner is beginning to be blown out.  Love how white your whites turned out.  Good job.  Where''s his eyes?  Solid 8.  PTL', '2002-12-16 22:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(173878, 9667, 4585, '<td valign="top">excellent use of patterns<br/></td>', 'excellent use of patterns', '2002-12-16 22:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(173880, 9710, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ll pronounce the judgement on this photo, then argue my case to improve it.  Judgement is  score of 6.  Guilty of miss-use of B&amp;W and lack of "wow" or interest catching.  The Argument:  Color might have given some interest appeal;  Also taken at more of an angle would have added depth to photo.  Right now in my eyes your depth is in the shadow and out of site.  Photographing on the length of the building would have done away with very bad shadows and added interestng depth.  Thinkg going for you are subject and focus.  PTL</td>', 'I''ll pronounce the judgement on this photo, then argue my case to improve it.  Judgement is  score of 6.  Guilty of miss-use of B&W and lack of "wow" or interest catching.  The Argument:  Color might have given some interest appeal;  Also taken at more of an angle would have added depth to photo.  Right now in my eyes your depth is in the shadow and out of site.  Photographing on the length of the building would have done away with very bad shadows and added interestng depth.  Thinkg going for you are subject and focus.  PTL', '2002-12-16 22:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
