(173883, 9666, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious.  What barbeque place do you work for?  Good shot and nice cropping.  The biggest is your coleslaw absorbed all your flash and blew itself out, maybe because of being on a white plate and black and white table.  The table white yellowed real bad the further from the plate it goes.  These aren''t really bad problems just little details that keep from getting tops.  7 is all i can give.  PTL</td>', 'Looks delicious.  What barbeque place do you work for?  Good shot and nice cropping.  The biggest is your coleslaw absorbed all your flash and blew itself out, maybe because of being on a white plate and black and white table.  The table white yellowed real bad the further from the plate it goes.  These aren''t really bad problems just little details that keep from getting tops.  7 is all i can give.  PTL', '2002-12-16 22:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
