(173965, 9660, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL.</td>', 'LOL.', '2002-12-16 23:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(173967, 9689, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what your job is.  All I know is I LOVE THIS PHOTO!  It is going in my favorites -  as my number 1.  Can you guess the score I''m giving?  This is an awesome shot of beautiful souroundings.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen a photo of any place that is this awesome.  I love the lights reflecting in the water and the hint of blue to the whole shot. The snow is beautiful.  I would love a murial of this. Way to go .  You out did yourself.   20 is your score.</td>', 'I don''t care what your job is.  All I know is I LOVE THIS PHOTO!  It is going in my favorites -  as my number 1.  Can you guess the score I''m giving?  This is an awesome shot of beautiful souroundings.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen a photo of any place that is this awesome.  I love the lights reflecting in the water and the hint of blue to the whole shot. The snow is beautiful.  I would love a murial of this. Way to go .  You out did yourself.   20 is your score.', '2002-12-16 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(173968, 9727, 1280, '<td valign="top">The image of the student could stand on it''s own with the nice red bg.  The art work competes, and cuts the picture in half.</td>', 'The image of the student could stand on it''s own with the nice red bg.  The art work competes, and cuts the picture in half.', '2002-12-16 23:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(173970, 9728, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a really good photo, with the exception that the background is too dark and swallows up parts of your items.  I don''t recognize your occupation from the picture so your title doesn''t make sense to me.  But i''ll give the photo an 8.  Lighter would be higher.</td>', 'This is a really good photo, with the exception that the background is too dark and swallows up parts of your items.  I don''t recognize your occupation from the picture so your title doesn''t make sense to me.  But i''ll give the photo an 8.  Lighter would be higher.', '2002-12-16 23:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(173971, 9816, 4648, '<td valign="top">Obviously you are digging for something.  But I find this photo disgusting.  Didn''t your mother ever teach you to not pick your nose in public.  Besides picking the nose you should have shaved.  And I''m thankful this is in B&amp;W.  I can think it is a set up.  In color it would look to real and be grotesque and make me sick.  I have a weak stomach.  But I have to give you an 8 for the quality of the photo - and I don''t want to.  But I will.</td>', 'Obviously you are digging for something.  But I find this photo disgusting.  Didn''t your mother ever teach you to not pick your nose in public.  Besides picking the nose you should have shaved.  And I''m thankful this is in B&W.  I can think it is a set up.  In color it would look to real and be grotesque and make me sick.  I have a weak stomach.  But I have to give you an 8 for the quality of the photo - and I don''t want to.  But I will.', '2002-12-16 23:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
