(174154, 9792, 4005, '<td valign="top">seems quite blurry to me! I''d liked to have it sharper - maybe with manual focus? As a macro? Don''t know, how you did it, but I guess, it could be better - sorry, 4 from me. Kaos<br/>ps: It''s a good idea - work on it!</td>', 'seems quite blurry to me! I''d liked to have it sharper - maybe with manual focus? As a macro? Don''t know, how you did it, but I guess, it could be better - sorry, 4 from me. Kaosps: It''s a good idea - work on it!', '2002-12-17 08:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
