(174548, 9712, 4648, '<td valign="top">Shame about the light coming thru the door, but you got arund it pretty well.  But it did make for a slightly dark photo.  Not enough to hurt much though, I can still see the cowboy boots.  Good focus and I understand the reason for the tight crop-the light.  Not bad for less than good condition.  Be a 7 from me.  PTL</td>', 'Shame about the light coming thru the door, but you got arund it pretty well.  But it did make for a slightly dark photo.  Not enough to hurt much though, I can still see the cowboy boots.  Good focus and I understand the reason for the tight crop-the light.  Not bad for less than good condition.  Be a 7 from me.  PTL', '2002-12-17 20:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(174549, 9660, 4648, '<td valign="top">Glad I''m not in your class.  I can''t even tell what subject it is, much less how to do it.  But I do know a technically good photo when I see it, and this is one.  The face is a little dark, but I think you did an exceptional job with the white board.  The shadow is a little distracting but overall not that bad. A 6 is very respectable.    PTL</td>', 'Glad I''m not in your class.  I can''t even tell what subject it is, much less how to do it.  But I do know a technically good photo when I see it, and this is one.  The face is a little dark, but I think you did an exceptional job with the white board.  The shadow is a little distracting but overall not that bad. A 6 is very respectable.    PTL', '2002-12-17 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
