(174552, 9674, 4648, '<td valign="top">If you build like you take photos I''ll hire you to renovate my home.  This is a fantastic photo.  At first I thought it was too busy, but the longer I look, the more I like it.  Very clear and sharp focus, colors are great.  Good composition with good execution.  I can''t give it less than an 8.  Good job.  PTL</td>', 'If you build like you take photos I''ll hire you to renovate my home.  This is a fantastic photo.  At first I thought it was too busy, but the longer I look, the more I like it.  Very clear and sharp focus, colors are great.  Good composition with good execution.  I can''t give it less than an 8.  Good job.  PTL', '2002-12-17 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(174553, 9611, 5520, '<td valign="top">i like it.............a lot</td>', 'i like it.............a lot', '2002-12-17 20:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(174554, 9685, 4648, '<td valign="top">Precious little girls.  You should be proud.  I love the spitting of the water.  Obviously her sister doesn''t trust her, cause she has her eyes closed so as to not get any in them.  Just a little dark.  Good focus and natural color.  I''m assuming the red around the hair is red shampoo for babies.  Good shot - worthy of a 7.  PTL</td>', 'Precious little girls.  You should be proud.  I love the spitting of the water.  Obviously her sister doesn''t trust her, cause she has her eyes closed so as to not get any in them.  Just a little dark.  Good focus and natural color.  I''m assuming the red around the hair is red shampoo for babies.  Good shot - worthy of a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-17 20:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(174556, 9786, 3936, '<td valign="top">Picture seems a bit dark.  Brighter lighting would really help.  Focus is good,  contrast is good, composition is good.  6</td>', 'Picture seems a bit dark.  Brighter lighting would really help.  Focus is good,  contrast is good, composition is good.  6', '2002-12-17 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
