(174924, 9775, 472, '<td valign="top">decent black and white, with a sense of humor.  the focus is good. the image itself could be a bit more interesting but i see you''re a student.</td>', 'decent black and white, with a sense of humor.  the focus is good. the image itself could be a bit more interesting but i see you''re a student.', '2002-12-18 14:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
