(175434, 9803, 1031, '<td valign="top">I always liked thisbut was never very good a it. Don''t really like the large dark area, but don''t know what I''d do differently; rest ofthe exposure is excellent.</td>', 'I always liked thisbut was never very good a it. Don''t really like the large dark area, but don''t know what I''d do differently; rest ofthe exposure is excellent.', '2002-12-19 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(175452, 9598, 4648, '<td valign="top">Hard to get it lighter without blowing out your drawing.  And that is my only draw back to this photo.  Othre wise it is very good.  May cropped off the bottom , from the desk top down and added some more at the top?  Just a thought.  Good pic though.  Worth a 7 with me.  PTL</td>', 'Hard to get it lighter without blowing out your drawing.  And that is my only draw back to this photo.  Othre wise it is very good.  May cropped off the bottom , from the desk top down and added some more at the top?  Just a thought.  Good pic though.  Worth a 7 with me.  PTL', '2002-12-19 16:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(175453, 9802, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the border and jacket.  Now to look at the photo.  Let''s see.  Needs to be a little lighter and sharper.  Good subject and set up.  Couldn''t get too much lighter or would blow out the board, I realize.  You don''t look much interested in the students - bad day?  At least your expression says so.  Decent photo worth a 6, because it is better than average.  PTL</td>', 'I love the border and jacket.  Now to look at the photo.  Let''s see.  Needs to be a little lighter and sharper.  Good subject and set up.  Couldn''t get too much lighter or would blow out the board, I realize.  You don''t look much interested in the students - bad day?  At least your expression says so.  Decent photo worth a 6, because it is better than average.  PTL', '2002-12-19 16:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(175472, 9725, 5731, '<td valign="top">Something should be in focus.</td>', 'Something should be in focus.', '2002-12-19 17:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(175480, 9747, 5731, '<td valign="top">This is a winning shot</td>', 'This is a winning shot', '2002-12-19 17:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175481, 9658, 5731, '<td valign="top">This is a winning shot</td>', 'This is a winning shot', '2002-12-19 17:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(175495, 9669, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and colors and contrast but youshould have framed differentl. The gas statio looks ''cut'' and the black part on the right does not bring anythin and do not ''define'' the rest of the picture. 5</td>', 'I like the tones and colors and contrast but youshould have framed differentl. The gas statio looks ''cut'' and the black part on the right does not bring anythin and do not ''define'' the rest of the picture. 5', '2002-12-19 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(175498, 9785, 4829, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Nice photo, lighteing and well...just an overall great photo. Loving a good local brew myself, I give this an -8-!</td>', 'Very cool! Nice photo, lighteing and well...just an overall great photo. Loving a good local brew myself, I give this an -8-!', '2002-12-19 19:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
