(175614, 9690, 5023, '<td valign="top">awesome lighting.  is that where you work,  at the rainforest cafe ?  looks like you killed two challenge birds with one stone here.  worth extra points +8</td>', 'awesome lighting.  is that where you work,  at the rainforest cafe ?  looks like you killed two challenge birds with one stone here.  worth extra points +8', '2002-12-20 05:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(175615, 9658, 5023, '<td valign="top">really realy great lighting and colors....high score   +9</td>', 'really realy great lighting and colors....high score   +9', '2002-12-20 05:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(175616, 9598, 5023, '<td valign="top">A lot of people in constrution here. cool</td>', 'A lot of people in constrution here. cool', '2002-12-20 05:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175617, 9763, 5023, '<td valign="top">Wow...awesome job</td>', 'Wow...awesome job', '2002-12-20 05:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(175618, 9825, 5023, '<td valign="top">great shot...love that angle</td>', 'great shot...love that angle', '2002-12-20 05:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(175619, 9640, 5023, '<td valign="top">great shot...love it</td>', 'great shot...love it', '2002-12-20 05:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(175620, 9638, 5023, '<td valign="top">I would do anything to have a job like this.  awesome shot</td>', 'I would do anything to have a job like this.  awesome shot', '2002-12-20 05:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(175635, 9760, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think your decision to present this in black &amp; white was a wise one, and it''s a good choice of angle.</td>', 'I think your decision to present this in black & white was a wise one, and it''s a good choice of angle.', '2002-12-20 06:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(175636, 9633, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is a well executed picture. I like the fact that you have everything in focus. Of the pictures of keyboards submitted, yours is the best.</td>', 'This is a well executed picture. I like the fact that you have everything in focus. Of the pictures of keyboards submitted, yours is the best.', '2002-12-20 06:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(175638, 9600, 5364, '<td valign="top">Your picture made me smile, thank you.</td>', 'Your picture made me smile, thank you.', '2002-12-20 06:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(175639, 9727, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of your picture, the tight cropping works for the subject. I am also pleased you haven''t overdone the border.</td>', 'I like the composition of your picture, the tight cropping works for the subject. I am also pleased you haven''t overdone the border.', '2002-12-20 06:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(175640, 9604, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the fact you have yourself in the picture, it puts your workplace in context.</td>', 'I like the fact you have yourself in the picture, it puts your workplace in context.', '2002-12-20 06:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(175643, 9688, 917, '<td valign="top">I want to like this, but theres just something wrong and I cant put my finger on it, perhaps its the jaggies, the overexposure, the models sleepy look, dunno.</td>', 'I want to like this, but theres just something wrong and I cant put my finger on it, perhaps its the jaggies, the overexposure, the models sleepy look, dunno.', '2002-12-20 07:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(175644, 9639, 917, '<td valign="top">Needs more light on the top half. Composition could be better, there is too much weight on the left side (tie hangs in that direction, and bar goes out of frame on that side too.</td>', 'Needs more light on the top half. Composition could be better, there is too much weight on the left side (tie hangs in that direction, and bar goes out of frame on that side too.', '2002-12-20 07:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(175645, 9642, 917, '<td valign="top">She looks a but nervous. Could use more contrast.</td>', 'She looks a but nervous. Could use more contrast.', '2002-12-20 07:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(175646, 9667, 917, '<td valign="top">Qt! have an extra point. I think the books could have been arranged a bit better, there is a line of reflection on the ASM book. The bottom seat could be set dead central, to help emphasise the way the seats dissappear up and to the right.</td>', 'Qt! have an extra point. I think the books could have been arranged a bit better, there is a line of reflection on the ASM book. The bottom seat could be set dead central, to help emphasise the way the seats dissappear up and to the right.', '2002-12-20 07:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175649, 9712, 917, '<td valign="top">Bright light in the background could have been avoided. Good pose, the worker is directing attention to the yellow pump by framing it an looking at it.</td>', 'Bright light in the background could have been avoided. Good pose, the worker is directing attention to the yellow pump by framing it an looking at it.', '2002-12-20 07:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(175651, 9607, 917, '<td valign="top">So what are you, Barfly?  Hustler? Waitress? Hooker? The photo is a bit nondescript, it needs a point of focus which could have been the sign on the roof, or  someone hanging about outside. Id have moved the green bin out of shot.</td>', 'So what are you, Barfly?  Hustler? Waitress? Hooker? The photo is a bit nondescript, it needs a point of focus which could have been the sign on the roof, or  someone hanging about outside. Id have moved the green bin out of shot.', '2002-12-20 07:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(175652, 9669, 917, '<td valign="top">Consider placing the 76 in the top right of frame.</td>', 'Consider placing the 76 in the top right of frame.', '2002-12-20 07:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(175653, 9642, 472, '<td valign="top">are you a dentist? :)  great portrait of a cute little girl. her earnest expression is just the greatest :)</td>', 'are you a dentist? :)  great portrait of a cute little girl. her earnest expression is just the greatest :)', '2002-12-20 07:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(175654, 9787, 917, '<td valign="top">Doesnt need the rightmost dish, particularly as it has clutter behind it.</td>', 'Doesnt need the rightmost dish, particularly as it has clutter behind it.', '2002-12-20 07:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(175655, 9675, 472, '<td valign="top">lol, yeah unless it''s a hundred degrees there!  p.s. if you own that costume, your life is complete!!!</td>', 'lol, yeah unless it''s a hundred degrees there!  p.s. if you own that costume, your life is complete!!!', '2002-12-20 07:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(175656, 9611, 917, '<td valign="top">Ugh UML, minus a point. Otherwise this is as good as it gets.</td>', 'Ugh UML, minus a point. Otherwise this is as good as it gets.', '2002-12-20 07:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(175658, 9638, 472, '<td valign="top">how beautiful. is this a dove or ptarmigan or something? looks like you cropped it froim a much bigger pic, but that doesn''t bother me too much.  i love his fat feathery chest!</td>', 'how beautiful. is this a dove or ptarmigan or something? looks like you cropped it froim a much bigger pic, but that doesn''t bother me too much.  i love his fat feathery chest!', '2002-12-20 07:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(175659, 9604, 472, '<td valign="top">looks like a festive place to work. i''d prolly throw up from all the sweetness and slogans! ; )</td>', 'looks like a festive place to work. i''d prolly throw up from all the sweetness and slogans! ; )', '2002-12-20 07:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
