(175929, 9631, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but it doesn''t really depict the job you do...photography, as stated in the title.  Well...ok...I see the rebirth connection if photography is a new thing.  But I don''t think this was the most creative approach to portraying photography as an occupation. 5</td>', 'I like this picture but it doesn''t really depict the job you do...photography, as stated in the title.  Well...ok...I see the rebirth connection if photography is a new thing.  But I don''t think this was the most creative approach to portraying photography as an occupation. 5', '2002-12-20 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
