(175938, 9667, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract with a bit of reality thrown in in the form of books.  I like it.  The wood tones are wonderful.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice abstract with a bit of reality thrown in in the form of books.  I like it.  The wood tones are wonderful.  Good job!', '2002-12-20 23:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(175939, 9794, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  I love abstracts. Color, exposure, and focus are all good, and the radial composition is very good.  I have no idea what these things are used for, but I don''t need to know...lol  I like it!</td>', 'I like this very much.  I love abstracts. Color, exposure, and focus are all good, and the radial composition is very good.  I have no idea what these things are used for, but I don''t need to know...lol  I like it!', '2002-12-20 23:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
