(175962, 9756, 5250, '<td valign="top">There is quite a bit of noise in the lights. Try using the program neatimage to fix this up. Also, a tighter cropping would improve the picture I think! jgillard5</td>', 'There is quite a bit of noise in the lights. Try using the program neatimage to fix this up. Also, a tighter cropping would improve the picture I think! jgillard5', '2002-12-21 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(175963, 9631, 5250, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, but I do not think it quite fits the challenge. Using photography as your occupation/what you do in a photography challenge is kinda weird. Everyone submitting photos in this challenge could submit any picture and say photography otherwise. jgillard6</td>', 'A nice photo, but I do not think it quite fits the challenge. Using photography as your occupation/what you do in a photography challenge is kinda weird. Everyone submitting photos in this challenge could submit any picture and say photography otherwise. jgillard6', '2002-12-21 06:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
