(175975, 9739, 4997, '<td valign="top">I really like the look of this, the composition and lighting is excellent, but it is missing something in the color spectrum..I don''t know what could have been done, but there seems to ba a lot of green that works against the brown/red for the picture.</td>', 'I really like the look of this, the composition and lighting is excellent, but it is missing something in the color spectrum..I don''t know what could have been done, but there seems to ba a lot of green that works against the brown/red for the picture.', '2002-12-21 09:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
