(176355, 9685, 3294, '<td valign="top">I think I understand your "occupation", however I think this photo could have been done differently (i''m trying to avoid using the word ''better'').  I like the framing but the white balance seems off and the flash casts such a harsh shadow, albeit a small shadow.  Looks like you caught the kid on the right in mid-blink.  Would have preferred to see the eyes open.  The red shampoo on the forhead is distracting as is the object on the tub ledge on the left there.  Creative way to illustrate motherhood.</td>', 'I think I understand your "occupation", however I think this photo could have been done differently (i''m trying to avoid using the word ''better'').  I like the framing but the white balance seems off and the flash casts such a harsh shadow, albeit a small shadow.  Looks like you caught the kid on the right in mid-blink.  Would have preferred to see the eyes open.  The red shampoo on the forhead is distracting as is the object on the tub ledge on the left there.  Creative way to illustrate motherhood.', '2002-12-22 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(176356, 9716, 3294, '<td valign="top">Your occupation is totally unclear... except the fact that you use a Mac in doing so.  Sorry, just doesn''t meet the challenge (not even with the title) to me.  (3)</td>', 'Your occupation is totally unclear... except the fact that you use a Mac in doing so.  Sorry, just doesn''t meet the challenge (not even with the title) to me.  (3)', '2002-12-22 18:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(176359, 9652, 3294, '<td valign="top">I upgraded this photo from a 7 to an 8.  I really like the way this bird is getting away... even away from the camera!  I think it''s a chicken, dunno.  Not sure what''s in the background there, either.  But this is a very creatve way to illustrate your occupation.  Good job!</td>', 'I upgraded this photo from a 7 to an 8.  I really like the way this bird is getting away... even away from the camera!  I think it''s a chicken, dunno.  Not sure what''s in the background there, either.  But this is a very creatve way to illustrate your occupation.  Good job!', '2002-12-22 18:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(176360, 9737, 3294, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but what do you do?  Let me know if you can.  <br/>...<br/> <br/>Never heard back about this job.  Sorry, it just doesn''t meet the challenge to me.  (3)</td>', 'Nice photo, but what do you do?  Let me know if you can.  ... Never heard back about this job.  Sorry, it just doesn''t meet the challenge to me.  (3)', '2002-12-22 19:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(176362, 9657, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colour. good luck</td>', 'Great composition and colour. good luck', '2002-12-22 19:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(176363, 9656, 3294, '<td valign="top">You occupation is unclear, except for the fact that you use a Mac to do it.  Pretty photo but it doesn''t tell me what you do... not even with the title.  I''ll guess and say graphic designer since I know two designers with the same Mac hardware.  (4)</td>', 'You occupation is unclear, except for the fact that you use a Mac to do it.  Pretty photo but it doesn''t tell me what you do... not even with the title.  I''ll guess and say graphic designer since I know two designers with the same Mac hardware.  (4)', '2002-12-22 19:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
