(176382, 9688, 2716, '<td valign="top">Euh, yes please.  Nice shot.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Euh, yes please.  Nice shot.  Jacko.  9', '2002-12-22 21:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(176383, 9600, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  Great shot.  Love the facial expression.  For you, cheap, real cheap.  Thanks for the chuckles.  jacko.  8</td>', 'Ha ha!  Great shot.  Love the facial expression.  For you, cheap, real cheap.  Thanks for the chuckles.  jacko.  8', '2002-12-22 21:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(176384, 9685, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ah ha ha!  The water spout makes the shot.  Good job.  What''s up with the red hair?  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Ah ha ha!  The water spout makes the shot.  Good job.  What''s up with the red hair?  Jacko.  8', '2002-12-22 21:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(176385, 9754, 2716, '<td valign="top">You got that right.  Real nice shot.  Tecnically real good.  Makes you want to see what she''s wearing (or not wearing).  I''ll give you a 10 to even out the scores from the feminisit types.  :)  Jacko   10.</td>', 'You got that right.  Real nice shot.  Tecnically real good.  Makes you want to see what she''s wearing (or not wearing).  I''ll give you a 10 to even out the scores from the feminisit types.  :)  Jacko   10.', '2002-12-22 21:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(176386, 9642, 2867, '<td valign="top">if it were''nt so posed it would be better</td>', 'if it were''nt so posed it would be better', '2002-12-22 21:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(176397, 9805, 2867, '<td valign="top">dont get the title-otherwise good.</td>', 'dont get the title-otherwise good.', '2002-12-22 21:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(176410, 9622, 3419, '<td valign="top">I would prefer being able to read what''s on the note paper - lack of focus and too much light on the paper makes this impossible.</td>', 'I would prefer being able to read what''s on the note paper - lack of focus and too much light on the paper makes this impossible.', '2002-12-22 22:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(176411, 9745, 3419, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but overall, the mice around the outside look grainy.</td>', 'I like the composition, but overall, the mice around the outside look grainy.', '2002-12-22 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(176413, 9736, 3419, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. It looks like a fan. I think the photo would be more dramatic with a pitch-black background.</td>', 'I like this very much. It looks like a fan. I think the photo would be more dramatic with a pitch-black background.', '2002-12-22 22:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(176414, 9710, 3419, '<td valign="top">The angles and shadows in this photo are very nice, but the area behind the columns looks a little grainy.</td>', 'The angles and shadows in this photo are very nice, but the area behind the columns looks a little grainy.', '2002-12-22 22:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(176415, 9645, 4648, '<td valign="top">What emotion, even without the title.  I hate posed shots and this does not look posed.  What a big job.  I like the soft focus, works well.  Would have liked it a little softer and not so bright ( or rich in color).  Toned down would have emitted more emotion.  I hope you can understand what I mean.  Still a very good shot.  Worth a 7 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'What emotion, even without the title.  I hate posed shots and this does not look posed.  What a big job.  I like the soft focus, works well.  Would have liked it a little softer and not so bright ( or rich in color).  Toned down would have emitted more emotion.  I hope you can understand what I mean.  Still a very good shot.  Worth a 7 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-22 22:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(176417, 9611, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Very creative. Unfortunately the technical part is not so good. Most striking is that the lighting of the photo on the screen doesn''t fit to the lighting on your real world hands. Also the photo is a little tilted CCW. However, because of the truly original and clever idea you get a pretty high score from me.<br/>Stephan</td>', 'Great idea! Very creative. Unfortunately the technical part is not so good. Most striking is that the lighting of the photo on the screen doesn''t fit to the lighting on your real world hands. Also the photo is a little tilted CCW. However, because of the truly original and clever idea you get a pretty high score from me.Stephan', '2002-12-22 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(176421, 9658, 2221, '<td valign="top">Cool colours! The composition is ok but because of the transparency it looks a bit crowded. The glass also seems to lack focus. And although you pretty much maxed out (148kB) the file size, I can make out some jpeg compression artifacts, e.g. on the writing of the right bottle.<br/>Stephan</td>', 'Cool colours! The composition is ok but because of the transparency it looks a bit crowded. The glass also seems to lack focus. And although you pretty much maxed out (148kB) the file size, I can make out some jpeg compression artifacts, e.g. on the writing of the right bottle.Stephan', '2002-12-22 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(176423, 9806, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not real sure of your profession from this shot.  It''s a very good photo, interest, color, focus, cropping.  I especially like the water on the right.  To me this just adds something to it.  I know you are going to be told it should have been cropped out, technically.  But I''m glad you left it in.  The grey buildings in the background make the color stand out, and I like the Christmas balls behind them.  The photo is a 10 but I don''t feel you''ve meet the challenge.  Again I can''t figure out your profession, unless it is a human interest reporter.  So I must give a 7.  Sorry PTL  Of course I''m assuming you do work.</td>', 'Not real sure of your profession from this shot.  It''s a very good photo, interest, color, focus, cropping.  I especially like the water on the right.  To me this just adds something to it.  I know you are going to be told it should have been cropped out, technically.  But I''m glad you left it in.  The grey buildings in the background make the color stand out, and I like the Christmas balls behind them.  The photo is a 10 but I don''t feel you''ve meet the challenge.  Again I can''t figure out your profession, unless it is a human interest reporter.  So I must give a 7.  Sorry PTL  Of course I''m assuming you do work.', '2002-12-22 23:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(176425, 9603, 3730, '<td valign="top">hmmm...your DOF doesn''t do much justice to an otherwise original photo. Having the entire thing in focus would have been a 9...like this....7 :(  Nice macro, though.</td>', 'hmmm...your DOF doesn''t do much justice to an otherwise original photo. Having the entire thing in focus would have been a 9...like this....7 :(  Nice macro, though.', '2002-12-22 23:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(176426, 9596, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I especially like the dog at the bottom.  No ones interested in your tiny fish, not even him.  I like the black background.  Wish you had lightened just a little.  BUT the challenge is "Your Profession".  What does this photo have to do with your profession?  I sure hope you''re not a fisherman.  If your were I don''t think you would have shown this photo.  Photo is an 8 but didn''t meet the challenge, so can only give a 6.  PTL  Of course this is assuming you work.  Forgive me if I''m wrong.</td>', 'Cute shot.  I especially like the dog at the bottom.  No ones interested in your tiny fish, not even him.  I like the black background.  Wish you had lightened just a little.  BUT the challenge is "Your Profession".  What does this photo have to do with your profession?  I sure hope you''re not a fisherman.  If your were I don''t think you would have shown this photo.  Photo is an 8 but didn''t meet the challenge, so can only give a 6.  PTL  Of course this is assuming you work.  Forgive me if I''m wrong.', '2002-12-22 23:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(176427, 9593, 2221, '<td valign="top">Witty title. I like the super close up on this. I justed checked how it would look in black&amp;white and I think it''s much better. Mostly because the reddish colour if the fingers disappears. The light streaks near the apple logo are a bit distratcting (from the logo). The grain is ok. I think it looks good on this photo.<br/>Stephan<br/></td>', 'Witty title. I like the super close up on this. I justed checked how it would look in black&white and I think it''s much better. Mostly because the reddish colour if the fingers disappears. The light streaks near the apple logo are a bit distratcting (from the logo). The grain is ok. I think it looks good on this photo.Stephan', '2002-12-22 23:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(176428, 9787, 2221, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting, but the small size really hurts the photo. -stephan</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting, but the small size really hurts the photo. -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(176429, 9756, 2221, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite photos this week. Great lighting! Very dramatic. I also like your composition. The focus could be a bit better but I guess the lighting conditions were not so good and you had to use a slow shutter. -stephan</td>', 'One of my favourite photos this week. Great lighting! Very dramatic. I also like your composition. The focus could be a bit better but I guess the lighting conditions were not so good and you had to use a slow shutter. -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(176430, 9751, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but focus is soft and a little grainy.</td>', 'Good photo, but focus is soft and a little grainy.', '2002-12-22 23:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(176432, 9670, 2221, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Almost looks like an advertisement. It shows that your job is creative thinking ;-) -stephan</td>', 'Simple but effective. Almost looks like an advertisement. It shows that your job is creative thinking ;-) -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(176433, 9667, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, focus, detail, and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice composition, focus, detail, and lighting.', '2002-12-22 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(176434, 9619, 4648, '<td valign="top">I would love to have this on the interstate at about 7:30 am.  I get where I was going with no problem.  I really like this shot down the front of you.  This is really a unique shot.  As far as I''m concerned, this is a great shot.  I like it.  Yes, it is blown out just past the bucket, but I''m not taking off for that.  Everything else outways that.  This is a 9 in my book.  Great job.  PTL</td>', 'I would love to have this on the interstate at about 7:30 am.  I get where I was going with no problem.  I really like this shot down the front of you.  This is really a unique shot.  As far as I''m concerned, this is a great shot.  I like it.  Yes, it is blown out just past the bucket, but I''m not taking off for that.  Everything else outways that.  This is a 9 in my book.  Great job.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(176435, 9797, 4648, '<td valign="top">"WOW".  10  PTL</td>', '"WOW".  10  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(176436, 9797, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great lighting! I love night shots. Nice industry theme. -stephan</td>', 'Great lighting! I love night shots. Nice industry theme. -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(176437, 9666, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the lighting in this photo makes this food look less appealing than it actually is.</td>', 'Good composition, but the lighting in this photo makes this food look less appealing than it actually is.', '2002-12-22 23:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(176438, 9739, 2221, '<td valign="top">Cool angle! I think I would have had cropped a bit from the bottom and a bit less from the top (if possible). -stephan</td>', 'Cool angle! I think I would have had cropped a bit from the bottom and a bit less from the top (if possible). -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(176439, 9658, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, lighting, focus and composition!</td>', 'Beautiful colors, lighting, focus and composition!', '2002-12-22 23:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(176440, 9594, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great motion shot.  Good focus on the rider.  Wish you hadn''t cropped out the front tire and left space behing the back.  I you didn''t get all of the front tire, I would have cropped off just a little of the back - just to make it uniform of the bike.  Great color.  Tight crop, but good anyway.  A great 8.  PTL</td>', 'Great motion shot.  Good focus on the rider.  Wish you hadn''t cropped out the front tire and left space behing the back.  I you didn''t get all of the front tire, I would have cropped off just a little of the back - just to make it uniform of the bike.  Great color.  Tight crop, but good anyway.  A great 8.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(176441, 9633, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good composition, lighting, and focus.</td>', 'Good composition, lighting, and focus.', '2002-12-22 23:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(176442, 9597, 2221, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit crowded at first sight but that looks good in this case here. Great lighting. One of my favourites this week. -stephan</td>', 'Looks a bit crowded at first sight but that looks good in this case here. Great lighting. One of my favourites this week. -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(176443, 9674, 2983, '<td valign="top">Very busy, but a decent arrangement.  It still needs more flow to it, but a good start.</td>', 'Very busy, but a decent arrangement.  It still needs more flow to it, but a good start.', '2002-12-22 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(176444, 9597, 3419, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to look at. Great color, composition, and capture of detail.</td>', 'There''s a lot to look at. Great color, composition, and capture of detail.', '2002-12-22 23:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(176445, 9764, 2221, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF. I would have tried to not to crop the plugs. -stephan</td>', 'Excellent DOF. I would have tried to not to crop the plugs. -stephan', '2002-12-22 23:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(176446, 9788, 4648, '<td valign="top">Fantastic focus.    Thank God for all of you policemen.  Proud of you.  And you should be proud of this shot.  Really great, and good challenge.  8 PTL</td>', 'Fantastic focus.    Thank God for all of you policemen.  Proud of you.  And you should be proud of this shot.  Really great, and good challenge.  8 PTL', '2002-12-22 23:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(176447, 9798, 3419, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, detail, and lighting. The uniform looks like silk!</td>', 'I like the composition, detail, and lighting. The uniform looks like silk!', '2002-12-22 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(176448, 9786, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Is this an example of good strong bones?</td>', 'Very interesting. Is this an example of good strong bones?', '2002-12-22 23:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(176449, 9798, 4648, '<td valign="top">"Doctor for A DAY"  Does this mean you are an actor and played the role of a doctor, or you could only take it for a day and quit.  I really like this composition.  Great job not blowing out the white jacket.  I like the focus and don''t let anyone tell you to sharpen it.  Good job worth an 8.  PTL</td>', '"Doctor for A DAY"  Does this mean you are an actor and played the role of a doctor, or you could only take it for a day and quit.  I really like this composition.  Great job not blowing out the white jacket.  I like the focus and don''t let anyone tell you to sharpen it.  Good job worth an 8.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(176450, 9799, 3419, '<td valign="top">Wow! What an interesting, abstract-looking photo. How did you do this?</td>', 'Wow! What an interesting, abstract-looking photo. How did you do this?', '2002-12-22 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(176451, 9667, 2983, '<td valign="top">Great picture overall.  There is pattern with a disruption to draw attention.  Great detail, lighting, and composition.</td>', 'Great picture overall.  There is pattern with a disruption to draw attention.  Great detail, lighting, and composition.', '2002-12-22 23:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(176452, 9798, 4079, '<td valign="top">Yeah! A doctor.  I''m a doctor, and I''m a good one at that.  Nice contrast and composition!</td>', 'Yeah! A doctor.  I''m a doctor, and I''m a good one at that.  Nice contrast and composition!', '2002-12-22 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(176454, 9816, 3419, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh gross! You certainly acquired a reaction from me! Good composition, focus, and capture of detail. LOL!</td>', 'Ohhhh gross! You certainly acquired a reaction from me! Good composition, focus, and capture of detail. LOL!', '2002-12-22 23:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(176455, 9631, 4648, '<td valign="top">Glad you put "Photography" in your title or wouldn''t have known your occupation.  That''s sneaky.  "Rebirth" ? must mean of the creek.  It appears to have two sources coming into it.  I really like the colors and the reflections, especially of the sky.  That adds awesome color to the whole thing.  Good focus and nice cropping.  Good composition and nice execution.  Deserves an 8 but I''m not too sure I would have know the profession without the title, so will give a 7.  PTL</td>', 'Glad you put "Photography" in your title or wouldn''t have known your occupation.  That''s sneaky.  "Rebirth" ? must mean of the creek.  It appears to have two sources coming into it.  I really like the colors and the reflections, especially of the sky.  That adds awesome color to the whole thing.  Good focus and nice cropping.  Good composition and nice execution.  Deserves an 8 but I''m not too sure I would have know the profession without the title, so will give a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(176456, 9718, 4079, '<td valign="top">nice comp!</td>', 'nice comp!', '2002-12-22 23:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(176458, 9642, 4648, '<td valign="top">Another great photo that takes the title to tell the profession.  Maybe if you had put a toothbrush in her hand you wouldn''t have need the title.  The chair isn''t enough and the card in her hand tells me nothing.  Good photo, though.  But must drop it to a 6 for a connived title.  It''s just not a talkative photo.  PTL</td>', 'Another great photo that takes the title to tell the profession.  Maybe if you had put a toothbrush in her hand you wouldn''t have need the title.  The chair isn''t enough and the card in her hand tells me nothing.  Good photo, though.  But must drop it to a 6 for a connived title.  It''s just not a talkative photo.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(176460, 9650, 4648, '<td valign="top">Does this mean you are a guitarist that dreams of being good or a retired person dreaming of learning how to play.  The photo doesn''t tell me.  But I do love the tone of the photo.  And it is a good photo, maybe cropped a little tight.  Just doesn''t tell me enough about you.  So must drop it to a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Does this mean you are a guitarist that dreams of being good or a retired person dreaming of learning how to play.  The photo doesn''t tell me.  But I do love the tone of the photo.  And it is a good photo, maybe cropped a little tight.  Just doesn''t tell me enough about you.  So must drop it to a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(176462, 9732, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great!  Like the B&amp;W.  Creative.  Technically good photo.  Not too sure how much the photo tells me with the title, but I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt, due to the creativeness of the shot - 8.  PTL</td>', 'Great!  Like the B&W.  Creative.  Technically good photo.  Not too sure how much the photo tells me with the title, but I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt, due to the creativeness of the shot - 8.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(176464, 9659, 4648, '<td valign="top">I wish the shot wasn''t so dark.  In the thumbnail I didn''t even see the club.  Like the yellow ball, but need to see the club.  5 is all I can go on this.  PTL</td>', 'I wish the shot wasn''t so dark.  In the thumbnail I didn''t even see the club.  Like the yellow ball, but need to see the club.  5 is all I can go on this.  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(176465, 9708, 4648, '<td valign="top">So this is what a scribe does.  Shame the lighting is not better.  Too much distraction in the upper right corner.  I''m still trying to figure out why a nose is laying on your desk, behind the wire.  Beautiful table and better light would have shown it off too.  Unclutter the table and better lighting and you have a good photo.   5  PTL</td>', 'So this is what a scribe does.  Shame the lighting is not better.  Too much distraction in the upper right corner.  I''m still trying to figure out why a nose is laying on your desk, behind the wire.  Beautiful table and better light would have shown it off too.  Unclutter the table and better lighting and you have a good photo.   5  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(176466, 9770, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute - good focus, nice texture.  I wish the shadows weren''t there.   Otherwise the paint is very pristine.  Like the indention the yellow paint makes, drawing the red into it''s hole.  Think I understand your reasoning for the frame but that shows the paints to be off center, and for no real reason.  With out the frame I probably wouldn''t have noticed the cropping.  For me this cost you a point.  8  PTL</td>', 'Cute - good focus, nice texture.  I wish the shadows weren''t there.   Otherwise the paint is very pristine.  Like the indention the yellow paint makes, drawing the red into it''s hole.  Think I understand your reasoning for the frame but that shows the paints to be off center, and for no real reason.  With out the frame I probably wouldn''t have noticed the cropping.  For me this cost you a point.  8  PTL', '2002-12-22 23:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
