(176489, 9799, 3936, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the great comments.  I took a lot of pictures and none of them were what I was looking for.  As it got closer to the deadline, this one just sort of kept getting my attention.  These were sold a few years back at Radio Shack and Spencers.  Called Lightning Storm, they were a white lightning plasma display.  This time exposure really surprised me.  I didn''t realize till then how much really goes on in there.</td>', 'Thank you all for the great comments.  I took a lot of pictures and none of them were what I was looking for.  As it got closer to the deadline, this one just sort of kept getting my attention.  These were sold a few years back at Radio Shack and Spencers.  Called Lightning Storm, they were a white lightning plasma display.  This time exposure really surprised me.  I didn''t realize till then how much really goes on in there.', '2002-12-23 00:13:16.000000', NULL, 0),
