(176685, 9743, 2058, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the kind comments :)<br/> <br/>Please not that the coffee in the cup is NOT our product, it''s just some old instant coffee I had lying around.  I dont have a grinder yet to grind up beans.  I think if I retake this photo, I''ll put some milk foam on the top to make it look like a cappucino.  8th place, my best yet :)<br/> <br/>Brian</td>', 'Thank you for all the kind comments :) Please not that the coffee in the cup is NOT our product, it''s just some old instant coffee I had lying around.  I dont have a grinder yet to grind up beans.  I think if I retake this photo, I''ll put some milk foam on the top to make it look like a cappucino.  8th place, my best yet :) Brian', '2002-12-23 02:14:56.000000', NULL, 0),
