(176713, 9606, 5158, '<td valign="top">Yiipeeeeee!<br/>I''m thrilled! Never have thought I could win!<br/>Thanx so much to everybody!<br/>And congrats to all other winners: it has been a tight race!<br/> <br/>It has been a really exiting week for me.<br/>When the challenge was called out 2 weeks ago, I instantly thought "That''s something for the colorful dyes in the lab."<br/>So I grabbed a few of them, made solutions and mixtures, filled them into the cells for spectroscopic measurement (polished quartz-glass), placed them on a mirror, put a UV-lamp next to them (you see its blue light in the reflections) and illuminated myself from below. That''s it!<br/>Only a little sharpening and contrast enhancing was done later.<br/> <br/>So thanx again everybody on this wonderfull site!<br/> <br/>Jörg</td>', 'Yiipeeeeee!I''m thrilled! Never have thought I could win!Thanx so much to everybody!And congrats to all other winners: it has been a tight race! It has been a really exiting week for me.When the challenge was called out 2 weeks ago, I instantly thought "That''s something for the colorful dyes in the lab."So I grabbed a few of them, made solutions and mixtures, filled them into the cells for spectroscopic measurement (polished quartz-glass), placed them on a mirror, put a UV-lamp next to them (you see its blue light in the reflections) and illuminated myself from below. That''s it!Only a little sharpening and contrast enhancing was done later. So thanx again everybody on this wonderfull site! Jörg', '2002-12-23 05:07:47.000000', NULL, 0),
