(178110, 9595, 3599, '<td valign="top">I liked this photo a lot.  I have to say that the glare on the forehead is a bit too bright.  And the area in the upper right corner was a little too bright to.  That said, sometimes I do find it ok if everything surrounding the subject is too bright as long as the subject isn''t.  I think you almost got that minus the forehead.  The composition is well done.  The picture meet the challenge in my opinion.  The focus was good, again I liked the photo and I gave it a 7. <br/>Hope this was somewhat helpful.  Happy Holidays!</td>', 'I liked this photo a lot.  I have to say that the glare on the forehead is a bit too bright.  And the area in the upper right corner was a little too bright to.  That said, sometimes I do find it ok if everything surrounding the subject is too bright as long as the subject isn''t.  I think you almost got that minus the forehead.  The composition is well done.  The picture meet the challenge in my opinion.  The focus was good, again I liked the photo and I gave it a 7. Hope this was somewhat helpful.  Happy Holidays!', '2002-12-25 20:16:42.000000', NULL, 0),
