(178999, 9595, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think you conveyed the impossibility of adequately juggling study, social life, and bodily survival. I gave this a 7 the first time around.<br/> <br/>I''m bothered most by the glare on the forehead, partly for the loss of detail, but more because I think it''s a little inconsistent with the theme you''re propounding. If the subject is falling asleep while studying, I expect a dim, late-night type of look. I suppose it could be early morning before the big exam, but it seems too bright for that.<br/> <br/>Either the late-night or morning look could be partly compensated for and emphasized by putting into duotone mode instead of the current grayscale mode.<br/> <br/>If you''re not familiar with duotones, I''d be happy to post a couple of tests with your image -- send me an email.</td>', 'I think you conveyed the impossibility of adequately juggling study, social life, and bodily survival. I gave this a 7 the first time around. I''m bothered most by the glare on the forehead, partly for the loss of detail, but more because I think it''s a little inconsistent with the theme you''re propounding. If the subject is falling asleep while studying, I expect a dim, late-night type of look. I suppose it could be early morning before the big exam, but it seems too bright for that. Either the late-night or morning look could be partly compensated for and emphasized by putting into duotone mode instead of the current grayscale mode. If you''re not familiar with duotones, I''d be happy to post a couple of tests with your image -- send me an email.', '2002-12-28 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(179074, 9792, 1031, '<td valign="top">Some people will say titles shouldn''t "save" a photo, but a title "clarifying the blurriness" might have helped here, as there''s a consistent prejudice here against soft- or out-of-focus pictures unless obviously and appropriately blurred.</td>', 'Some people will say titles shouldn''t "save" a photo, but a title "clarifying the blurriness" might have helped here, as there''s a consistent prejudice here against soft- or out-of-focus pictures unless obviously and appropriately blurred.', '2002-12-29 02:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
