(829385, 9606, 22748, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by amsmyth:</b></div><hr/><i> This was a stunning image...what is the little blue light up over the left ear? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s a reflection in the liquid in the dropper he''s using.<br/> <br/>This image is THE BOMB. It is awesome. Perfect lighting on the chemist''s face as well; just enough to show it, but not enough to distract from the foreground. It keeps the interest.</td>', 'Originally posted by amsmyth: This was a stunning image...what is the little blue light up over the left ear?   It''s a reflection in the liquid in the dropper he''s using. This image is THE BOMB. It is awesome. Perfect lighting on the chemist''s face as well; just enough to show it, but not enough to distract from the foreground. It keeps the interest.', '2004-07-28 08:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
